             "color": "#1E3A43"
            }
           },
           "hide": null,
           "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Gleneagle Apartments sit ten minutes of a walk outside the adorable town of Killarney.  Accommodations are two-bedroom apartments consisting of twin and quad rooms.  The apartments are nestled in Killarney National Park and a stone's throw from the Killarney Lakes, Muckross House, Ross Castle, and Torc Waterfall.  It is a great location and spring board for the Dingle Peninsula and Ring of Kerry Tours.  </span></p>"
          }
         ],
